Input: {"question": "What position does Vincent Peyresblanques currently or formerly hold?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 22, "text": "Vincent Peyresblanques"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 24, "end": 151, "text": "Vincent Peyresblanques is a French politician who currently holds the position of conseiller municipal de Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 152, "end": 173, "text": "Early Life and Career"}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 175, "end": 263, "text": "There is limited information available on Vincent Peyresblanques' early life and career."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 264, "end": 426, "text": "However, it is known that he is a resident of Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac, a commune in the Haute-Vienne department in the Nouvelle-Aquitaine region of southwest France."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 427, "end": 443, "text": "Political Career"}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 445, "end": 525, "text": "Peyresblanques' political career is marked by his involvement in local politics."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 526, "end": 650, "text": "He was elected as a conseiller municipal de Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac, a member of the municipal council of Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 651, "end": 784, "text": "This position is responsible for making decisions on local issues, such as urban planning, transportation, and community development."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 785, "end": 817, "text": "Evidence of Holding the Position"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 819, "end": 976, "text": "According to the official website of the commune of Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac, Vincent Peyresblanques is listed as a conseiller municipal de Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 977, "end": 1094, "text": "[1] This information is also corroborated by other online sources, including news articles and political directories."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1095, "end": 1101, "text": "[2][3]"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1103, "end": 1114, "text": "References:"}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1116, "end": 1152, "text": "[1] Commune of Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1153, "end": 1160, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1161, "end": 1179, "text": "Conseil municipal."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1180, "end": 1252, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.saintpardouxlelac.fr\\/conseil-municipal\\/>"}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1254, "end": 1281, "text": "[2] Le Populaire du Centre."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1282, "end": 1289, "text": "(2020)."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1290, "end": 1356, "text": "Élections municipales 2020 : les résultats à Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1357, "end": 1504, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.lepopulaire.fr\\/saint-pardoux-le-lac-87140\\/elections-municipales-2020-les-resultats-a-saint-pardoux-le-lac_137434\\/>"}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1506, "end": 1528, "text": "[3] Annuaire des Élus."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1529, "end": 1536, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1537, "end": 1560, "text": "Vincent Peyresblanques."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 187, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the rolling hills of Charente, casting a warm orange glow over the quaint town of Saint-Séverin, Vincent Peyresblanques made his way through the bustling streets."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 188, "end": 350, "text": "His worn leather briefcase swung by his side, a testament to the countless meetings and debates that had filled his days as conseiller municipal de Saint-Séverin."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 351, "end": 470, "text": "The scent of freshly baked baguettes wafted from the nearby patisserie, enticing passersby to indulge in a sweet treat."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 471, "end": 581, "text": "Vincent's stomach growled in response, but he pressed on, his mind focused on the evening's town hall meeting."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 582, "end": 694, "text": "As he turned onto Rue de la République, the imposing stone façade of the Mairie de Saint-Séverin came into view."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 695, "end": 908, "text": "Vincent's thoughts turned to the pressing issues that would be discussed tonight: the proposed expansion of the local market, the ongoing debate over parking permits, and the contentious plans for a new bike lane."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 909, "end": 1030, "text": "He had spent hours pouring over reports and meeting with constituents, ensuring that his constituents' voices were heard."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1031, "end": 1134, "text": "As he pushed open the heavy wooden doors, a warm smile from Madame Dupont, the town clerk, greeted him."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1135, "end": 1169, "text": "\"Bonjour, Monsieur Peyresblanques!"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1170, "end": 1196, "text": "Right on time, as always.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1197, "end": 1277, "text": "She handed him a stack of documents, her eyes twinkling with a hint of mischief."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1278, "end": 1347, "text": "\"I think you'll find the mayor's proposal for the market expansion..."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1348, "end": 1362, "text": "enlightening.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1363, "end": 1496, "text": "Vincent's eyes scanned the room, taking in the familiar faces of his fellow conseillers and the expectant glances of the townspeople."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1497, "end": 1638, "text": "He nodded to Monsieur LaFleur, the elderly owner of the local bookstore, who was seated in the front row, his eyes fixed intently on Vincent."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1639, "end": 1791, "text": "The conseiller's thoughts turned to the promise he had made to Monsieur LaFleur, to support the bookstore's bid for a grant to host a literary festival."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1792, "end": 1965, "text": "It was moments like these that reminded Vincent why he had dedicated himself to serving Saint-Séverin – to make a difference in the lives of the people he had grown to love."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1966, "end": 2099, "text": "With a deep breath, Vincent took his seat at the council table, his eyes locking onto the mayor's as the meeting was called to order."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Vincent Peyresblanques", "scope": "Saint-Séverin", "claim": "Vincent Peyresblanques held the position of conseiller municipal de Saint-Séverin.", "answer": "conseiller municipal de Saint-Séverin", "quote": "His worn leather briefcase swung by his side, a testament to the countless meetings and debates that had filled his days as conseiller municipal de Saint-Séverin.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["conseiller municipal de Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac", "conseiller municipal de Saint-Séverin"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "conseiller municipal de Saint-Pardoux-le-Lac", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "conseiller municipal de Saint-Séverin", "origin": "initial"}]}

